# Build and install wits from the tree this repository carries.
#
# This is the unit that makes bootstrap unable to depend on wits: wits does not
# exist on the machine until here, and getting here needed a C++ toolchain,
# meson, ninja and cargo. Anything upstream of this point has to work with a
# POSIX shell and nothing else.
#
# No `unless`: whether an installed binary matches this source tree is not
# something a cheap probe can answer, so re-entry leans on the state record,
# which the content digest invalidates when the wits sources change.
kind: action
capabilities: develop
requires: cpp-toolchain, rust-toolchain
